	(text "Car path: F1 -> Z1 -> Q1/U1 ideal diode -> PPTRACKER -> J2. CAN/K-line pass straight through J1 -> J2; IGN passes through S1D1 (sheet 1).\nPPTRACKER: 12-14.5 V from the car, ~9 V from VBOOST via D2 on backup.\nParked drain from VCAR: the 7.7 M sense divider (~1.6 uA) and U1, the LTC4412HV (~13 uA).\nJ1/J2 (v3.4): 1 SPARE, 2 GND, 3 CAN_H/K, 4 power, 5 IGN, 6 CAN_L/L."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24.765 174.625 0)
		(effects
